<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HK WorldBank - 글로벌 차세대 디지털 금융 플랫폼</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-main: #0a0518;
            --bg-card: #130b2b;
            --accent-cyan: #00f0ff;
            --accent-purple: #9d00ff;
            --accent-pink: #ff007f;
            --accent-gold: #ffd700;
            --accent-emerald: #00ff88;
            --text-main: #ffffff;
            --text-muted: #a0a5c0;
            --border-glow: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-main);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.5;
            padding-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 16px;
        }

        /* 헤더 */
        header {
            background: rgba(19, 11, 43, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            padding: 12px 0;
        }

        .header-content {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .referrer-id {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-purple), var(--accent-cyan));
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4);
        }

        .lang-select {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-cyan);
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            outline: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        /* 섹션 공통 스타일 */
        .section-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-top: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.15);
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.5);
        }

        /* 1. AGI 삐니 섹션 */
        .agi-box {
            background: rgba(10, 5, 24, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.4);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px;
        }

        .chat-display {
            height: 120px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .chat-input-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .chat-input {
            flex: 1;
            background: var(--bg-main);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .btn-neon {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--accent-purple));
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 0 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4);
        }

        /* 2. 10대 핵심 모듈 (2x5 그리드) */
        .grid-2x5 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 12px;
        }

        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .grid-2x5 {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
            }
        }

        .module-item {
            background: rgba(10, 5, 24, 0.8);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        }

        .module-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .module-icon {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .module-name {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .module-desc {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            word-break: keep-all;
        }

        /* 3. UBI 시뮬레이터 */
        .sim-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        @media (min-width: 600px) {
            .sim-stats {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        .stat-card {
            background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-cyan);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .stat-value {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--accent-emerald);
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.5);
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        /* 4. 미디어 섹션 */
        .media-container {
            position: relative;
            padding-bottom: 56.25%;
            height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-purple);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .media-container iframe {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border: none;
        }

        /* 푸터 */
        footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            padding-top: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .social-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }

        .social-btn {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-cyan);
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .social-btn:hover {
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
            color: var(--bg-main);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent-cyan);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="container header-content">
            <div class="referrer-id">추천인 ID: ljw2358</div>
            <select class="lang-select" id="langSelect">
                <option value="ko">한국어 (Korean)</option>
                <option value="en">English</option>
                <option value="ja">日本語</option>
                <option value="zh">中文</option>
                <option value="es">Español</option>
                <option value="vi">Tiếng Việt</option>
            </select>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
        <!-- Section 1: 고객센터 AGI '삐니' -->
        <section class="section-card">
            <h2 class="section-title">🤖 1. 고객센터 AGI '삐니'</h2>
            <div class="agi-box">
                <div class="chat-display" id="chatDisplay">
                    <p><strong>삐니:</strong> 안녕하세요! HK WorldBank 글로벌 고객지원 AGI 삐니입니다. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?</p>
                </div>
                <div class="chat-input-group">
                    <input type="text" class="chat-input" id="chatInput" placeholder="질문 내용을 입력하세요 (예: 예치 이율, UBI 모델 등)...">
                    <button class="btn-neon" onclick="sendMessage()">전송</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 2: 10대 핵심 모듈 (2x5 그리드) -->
        <section class="section-card">
            <h2 class="section-title">⚡ 2. 10대 핵심 모듈</h2>
            <div class="grid-2x5">
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-icon">🔗</div>
                    <div class="module-name">지갑연결</div>
                    <div class="module-desc">DID 및 생체인증</div>
                </div>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-icon">💸</div>
                    <div class="module-name">송금</div>
                    <div class="module-desc">글로벌 실시간 전송</div>
                </div>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-icon">💳</div>
                    <div class="module-name">결제</div>
                    <div class="module-desc">초고속 TPS 정산</div>
                </div>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-icon">🏦</div>
                    <div class="module-name">예치</div>
                    <div class="module-desc">최대 31.4% APY</div>
                </div>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-icon">🎁</div>
                    <div class="module-name">보상</div>
                    <div class="module-desc">기여도 기반 리워드</div>
                </div>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-icon">🌐</div>
                    <div class="module-name">기본소득</div>
                    <div class="module-desc">UBI 자동 배분</div>
                </div>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-icon">🔄</div>
                    <div class="module-name">토큰스왑</div>
                    <div class="module-desc">멀티체인 교환</div>
                </div>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-icon">🔀</div>
                    <div class="module-name">DEX스왑</div>
                    <div class="module-desc">탈중앙 유동성 거래</div>
                </div>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-icon">🔒</div>
                    <div class="module-name">LP스테이킹</div>
                    <div class="module-desc">유동성 공급 이자</div>
                </div>
                <div class="module-item">
                    <div class="module-icon">🥧</div>
                    <div class="module-name">PI 수량</div>
                    <div class="module-desc">Test Pi 연동 관리</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 3: 순수익 30%~60% 사회환원 (UBI) 모델 -->
        <section class="section-card">
            <h2 class="section-title">🌱 3. 순수익 30%~60% 사회환원 (UBI) 모델</h2>
            <div class="sim-stats">
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-value">30% ~ 60%</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">자동 사회환원 비율</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-value">100%</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">투명한 실시간 대시보드 검증</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center;">
                HK WorldBank는 발생한 순수익의 30%를 UBI(기본소득)로 배분하며, 최대 60%까지 글로벌 사회 재단 및 이웃 환원에 분배합니다.
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 4: 미디어 & 영상 -->
        <section class="section-card">
            <h2 class="section-title">📺 4. 미디어 채널</h2>
            <div class="media-container">
                <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLx0sYbCqOb8TBPRjTS33bX2-hEJMeNUGH" title="HK WorldBank Media" allowfullscreen></iframe>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <p>공식 문의: <a href="mailto:support@hkwb.world" style="color: var(--accent-cyan);">support@hkwb.world</a></p>
            <div class="social-links">
                <a href="https://youtube.com/@Hyekong2026" target="_blank" class="social-btn">YouTube</a>
                <a href="https://tiktok.com/@hyekong2026" target="_blank" class="social-btn">TikTok</a>
            </div>
            <p style="margin-top: 16px; opacity: 0.6;">&copy; HK WorldBank. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script>
        function sendMessage() {
            const input = document.getElementById('chatInput');
            const display = document.getElementById('chatDisplay');
            if (!input.value.trim()) return;

            const userMsg = document.createElement('p');
            userMsg.innerHTML = `<strong>사용자:</strong> ${input.value}`;
            display.appendChild(userMsg);

            const botMsg = document.createElement('p');
            botMsg.style.color = '#00f0ff';
            botMsg.innerHTML = `<strong>삐니:</strong> 요청하신 "${input.value}"에 대해 최적의 가이드를 처리 중입니다.`;
            display.appendChild(botMsg);

            input.value = '';
            display.scrollTop = display.scrollHeight;
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
